# ORCA 6.1.1-generated results: EULA applies; rights clearance pending

Copyright (c) 2026 Aris Tsai to the extent that original authorship rights apply.

This directory includes an author-produced archive of input files, coordinates, and ORCA-generated calculation outputs. **CC BY 4.0 does not grant unrestricted commercial reuse of ORCA-generated DATA or eliminate governing ORCA EULA restrictions.** A June 2021 ORCA academic license (covering ORCA 4.0 and later) permits publication in the scientific literature but restricts database redistribution and commercial uses, and requires disclaimer notices. The exact EULA accepted for ORCA 6.1.1 is still to be checked. Read `../ORCA_EULA_RIGHTS_NOTICE.md`.

Earlier repository wording suggesting that all data in this directory were freely reusable under CC BY 4.0 was overbroad insofar as it overlooked the upstream EULA. No ORCA binary or program libraries are supplied. No scientific file or checksum is changed.

Source: https://hpc.hku.hk/wp-content/uploads/document/orca-eula_2021.pdf

